  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41301" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build capacity of national sectoral actors to engage in climate action, and increase coordination capacities of the Ministry of Environment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The capacities of the personnel of the sectoral technical ministries (AFAT, Energy), of the private sector wishing to inform the MRV Mechanism are reinforced in the national MRV system. 
The capacities of representatives of the private sector, of the Ministries of Finance and Planning and of the national coordination unit involved in the mobilization of financing are strengthened in terms of climate finance. 
The capacities of the technical services involved in the implementation of the national low-carbon strategy (environment, energy, agriculture, livestock, transport, etc.) are strengthened in terms of carbon assessment tools.</narrative>
  </description>
